{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20186","headline":"列仙文 清虚真人 · 孟郊","name":"列仙文 清虚真人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歘驾空清虚，徘徊西华馆。\n琼轮暨晨抄，虎骑逐烟散。\n惠风振丹旌，明烛朗八焕。\n解襟墉房内，神铃鸣璀璨。\n栖景若林柯，九弦空中弹。\n遗我积世忧，释此千载叹。\n怡眄无极已，终夜复待旦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}